  "content": "<h2>Tinkers' Jewelry EX</h2>\n<p>An extended mod of the <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>Tinkers' Jewelry</span></a> that adds more &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a>.</p>\n<h2>v1.0.1</h2>\n<p>Add TonJEI compatible</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1268977/description_fff91fc0-c6af-4542-b847-9cb8c8fb12ed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"428\" height=\"277\"></p>\n<h2>New parts：</h2>\n<h3>Chain</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ba0f8268-f770-40d1-af7b-a75a66fa8638.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"323\" height=\"154\"></p>\n<h3>Curved Plate</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0ab8bc9b-ee2f-4010-b570-1ba42455b945.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<h3>Lining</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_78c1d5ba-b8b5-4fb6-a654-b21d80729f0a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"335\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>New Curios</h2>\n<h3>Bracelet</h3>\n<p>1 curved plate, 1 gem</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e3d5248-e13f-4473-8d1a-42ec74303286.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"146\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_99545bd8-8fa9-4f42-8c6b-08924e556d29.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"333\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<h3>Charm</h3>\n<p>1 chain, 1 curved plate, 1 gem</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_32922eae-3710-472b-bbf0-a3f12478039a.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_26388cd8-781b-427e-89ff-553bfdfeaecf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"268\" height=\"147\"></p>\n<h3>Crown</h3>\n<p>1 curved plate, 3 gems</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8f25cfbb-29f7-4401-bc36-1319a79dc0ed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"139\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2150ec6b-1ce7-40c5-9b68-0e1bf1f3498c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"308\" height=\"142\"></p>\n<h3>Glove</h3>\n<p>1 lining, 1 curved plate, 1 gem</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f39f8870-d280-4480-a3fc-383a8489b7e1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"146\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7795df18-72cb-4554-b9a3-fe3aa2cafd06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"331\" height=\"153\"></p>\n<h3>Necklace</h3>\n<p>1 chain, 1 gem</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d5ac340f-cbfe-473a-94ac-364031f371a4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"139\" height=\"140\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fdb720bf-99a2-4a61-9d2c-16811cbcf449.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"330\" height=\"146\"></p>",
